/E (The ABS chassis, from the current version, presented positive results in the Autodesk Inventor simulation, compared to PMMA, demonstrating good structural performance. Applying the same 500 N force to the front part of the chassis, it was possible to analyze its behavior and the distribution of stresses. The results demonstrated good resistance to loads, maintaining the integrity of the chassis and exhibiting little deformation. Thus, the test validated ABS as a structural material, proving to be more resistant and suitable for the robot in real game situations. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [71]
>>
endobj
