/P 20 0 R
/E (The graph \(Figure 26\) presents the comparison of the number of goals scored in 10-minute tests between the robots from the 2025 and 2026 seasons. The points in red represent the 2025 base kicking system, while the points in burgundy correspond to the 2026 optimized robot. The gray expectation line indicates the performance target projected by the team, positioned above the best experimental result achieved, serving as a reference for the expected potential for system development.)
/Pg 10 0 R
