472 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 20 0 R
/E (One of the main evolutions of the project was the replacement of acrylic sheets with PCBs \(Printed Circuit Boards\) as structural elements, integrated into the chassis architecture. This improved the organization of the modules and promoted a reduction in wiring, resulting in a more compact, robust system that is less susceptible to failures. In addition, there was a reduction in mass, better distribution of mechanical loads, and improvements in assembly, maintainability, and modularity.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [451]
>>
endobj
